# paperduet
===
 Mirror your translation! A lightweight AI paper translator for Mac and Windows. The original PDF and its translation sit side by side, page for page, with formulas, figures and tables in place. Translates into eight languages with a local model: no sign-in, no fees, and papers stay on your computer.
